The following options control optimizations:
  --param=lto-partition-locality-cloning= 	maximal
  --param=lto-partition-locality-heuristics= 	[default]
  -O<number>                  		
  -Ofast                      		
  -Og                         		
  -Os                         		
  -Oz                         		
  -faggressive-loop-optimizations 	[enabled]
  -falign-functions           		[disabled]
